'''Quicksand''' is a detrimental [[ground effect]] and corresponding stacking debuff which can stack up to ten stacks while standing in its area. Each stack of Quicksand reduces [[action speed]] by 5% (up to 50%), and visually causes affected entities to sink into the ground. Stacks of Quicksand can be removed gradually by moving while not on quicksand.

==Sources==
* [[Dusty Chamber]] in the [[Azurite Mine]]
* [[Shakari]] ([[The Oasis]] boss)
* [[Terror of the Infinite Drifts]] ({{il|Desert Spring Map}} boss)
* [[Mirage]] [[Ultimatum]] modifiers (Quicksand I-IV)

